        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The free daily credit bonus that appeared when you kept a daily usage streak is gone. In its place, streak days now earn points toward a rewards system where points can unlock new appearance themes, alongside existing methods like inviting a friend or maintaining a subscription. If you are on a limited access tier, you earn one-tenth of the standard point amounts from your streak days. No action is needed to start earning these points, and the old daily credit perk no longer applies.",
